            devotionalTitle: "Restored Years",
            devotionalText: "God doesn't just give you a fresh start — He promises to restore what was lost. The years wasted in addiction, broken relationships, wrong turns — God can repay them. Not by erasing the past, but by making the future so abundant that it redeems the lost years. You haven't run out of time. God's restoration plan is bigger than your loss.",
