            devotionalText: "This isn't a renovation — it's a recreation. In Christ, you're not an improved version of your old self; you're an entirely new creation. The old has gone. Past tense. Done. The new is here. Present tense. Now. You don't have to earn this transformation or wait for it to kick in. If you're in Christ, the new creation has already come.",
            prayerText: "Lord, I am a new creation in Christ. The old has gone and the new is here. Help me live from this identity, not my old one. When shame whispers that I'm still the person I used to be, remind me that I've been made new. I'm not improving the old — I'm living in the new. In Jesus' name, amen.",
